{"id":"vod_bf_45885","vodId":"45885","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"只有神知道的世界第二季","name_cn":"只有神知道的世界第二季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-47/c86404dd3be3a3533645899a8e79df05.jpg"},"summary":"以若木民喜的同名漫画为原著的动画《只有神知道的世界》宣布第1季在2011年1月4日起在日本重播的同时，在其连载的漫画杂志《周刊少年 SUNDAY》上宣布推出第二季动画《只有神知道的世界Ⅱ》。擅长恋爱游戏甚至被称为“攻略之神”的少年——桂木桂马在来自冥界的恶魔艾露西的强迫下，与她结下了地狱的契约。两人已经一起成功捕捉了四只驱魂。这一次在二人面前出现了新的驱魂队成员。在这一季里，将会出现新的攻略对象，武术传承者春日楠，现实女孩中的现实女孩小阪千寻以及学校的实习教师长濑纯。攻略故事就由此再一次展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 21:00:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://s2.bfllvip.com/video/zhiyoushenzhidaodeshijiedierji/54ee3622daa8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://s2.bfllvip.com/video/zhiyoushenzhidaodeshijiedierji/32851fa17bdf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://s1.bfllvip.com/video/zhiyoushenzhidaodeshijiedierji/315334492b9d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://s2.bfllvip.com/video/zhiyoushenzhidaodeshijiedierji/700d05bd0fa9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://s2.bfllvip.com/video/zhiyoushenzhidaodeshijiedierji/9be4595fc16d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://s1.bfllvip.com/video/zhiyoushenzhidaodeshijiedierji/77389bd6d4e5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://s2.bfllvip.com/video/zhiyoushenzhidaodeshijiedierji/3342d3b9e65f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://s2.bfllvip.com/video/zhiyoushenzhidaodeshijiedierji/47872181bb98/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://s2.bfllvip.com/video/zhiyoushenzhidaodeshijiedierji/f6d6a2caccbb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410245Tz3xfweindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024qymoI9faindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https:/